OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged over garage and
OL,4,Awarehouse fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged in connection
OL,7,Fwith a large fire at a garage and
OL,8,Ffurniture warehouse.
OL,10,FThe blaze broke out at the site on
OL,11,FFernhill Road, Bootle, Merseyside,
OL,12,Fshortly after 20:00 BST on Tuesday.
OL,14,FThere were no injuries but nearby homes
OL,15,Fwere evacuated as a precaution and road
OL,16,Fclosures were put in place.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
