OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged over garage and
OL,4,Awarehouse fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FKurram Shahzad, 37, who lives in Belle
OL,7,FVale, has been charged with arson with
OL,8,Frecklessness as to whether life was
OL,9,Fendangered. He has been remanded to
OL,10,Fappear at Wirral Magistrates' Court
OL,11,Ftoday.
